e", "time": 6035.75, "timestamp": "01:40:35", "text": "但在工作环境中，有人"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6038.47, "timestamp": "01:40:38", "text": "伴随。所以，我喜欢你不是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6041.59, "timestamp": "01:40:41", "text": "你不是强制性的，你说的对吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6043.75, "timestamp": "01:40:43", "text": "陪同，但因为我是唯一一个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6046.87, "timestamp": "01:40:46", "text": "喝酒的人。所以感觉就像这样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6049.91, "timestamp": "01:40:49", "text": "你必须被强制饮酒。所以"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6051.99, "timestamp": "01:40:51", "text": "我一边喝着萨乔酒一边喝酒"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6053.91, "timestamp": "01:40:53", "text": "就是这样。但是，如果你是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6056.47, "timestamp": "01:40:56", "text": "他们现在就要喝啤酒"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6057.91, "timestamp": "01:40:57", "text": "非常轻。所以你不用担心"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6059.43, "timestamp": "01:40:59", "text": "比起很快醉酒，"}]